{"uid":"6e9050207a636d4c","name":"test_no_new_review_iteration_starts_at_an_already_expired_boundary[deadline]","fullName":"tests.test_deadline#test_no_new_review_iteration_starts_at_an_already_expired_boundary","historyId":"21242c1dda4063c5e6a588c9e50bcab0","time":{"start":1791959551995,"stop":1791959552053,"duration":58},"description":"A supervisor entering `review` with its budget already spent\n    dispatches NO review iteration (the scripted agent is never called at\n    all) and holds `exhausted` with a null verdict through the shared C.1\n    freeze path.\n\n    Episode 1 is Section C's own resume shape (plan, worker COMPLETE,\n    review interrupted), purely to leave a run directory whose resume\n    point genuinely IS `review` with a task already complete -- so\n    episode 2's fresh supervisor is positioned exactly where a resumed run\n    that still owes a verdict would be, rather than at a boundary this\n    file's harness hand-placed. Episode 2 is the probe: its boundary is\n    already expired before its first dispatch -- by an expired job\n    deadline (`job_timeout_s=0.0`) or by an exhausted iteration budget\n    (`iterations_used == iterations`), the two halves `budget_left()`\n    checks -- and it must start nothing.\n    ","descriptionHtml":"<p>A supervisor entering <code>review</code> with its budget already spent<br />\ndispatches NO review iteration (the scripted agent is never called at<br />\nall) and holds <code>exhausted</code> with a null verdict through the shared C.1<br />\nfreeze path.</p>\n<pre><code>Episode 1 is Section C's own resume shape (plan, worker COMPLETE,\nreview interrupted), purely to leave a run directory whose resume\npoint genuinely IS `review` with a task already complete -- so\nepisode 2's fresh supervisor is positioned exactly where a resumed run\nthat still owes a verdict would be, rather than at a boundary this\nfile's harness hand-placed. Episode 2 is the probe: its boundary is\nalready expired before its first dispatch -- by an expired job\ndeadline (`job_timeout_s=0.0`) or by an exhausted iteration budget\n(`iterations_used == iterations`), the two halves `budget_left()`\nchecks -- and it must start nothing.\n</code></pre>\n","status":"passed","flaky":false,"newFailed":false,"newBroken":false,"newPassed":false,"retriesCount":0,"retriesStatusChange":false,"beforeStages":[{"name":"event_loop_policy","time":{"start":1791959389075,"stop":1791959389075,"duration":0},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"tmp_path_factory","time":{"start":1791959389076,"stop":1791959389076,"duration":0},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"monkeypatch","time":{"start":1791959551981,"stop":1791959551981,"duration":0},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"_isolate_ambient_home_in_process","time":{"start":1791959551981,"stop":1791959551985,"duration":4},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"_scrub_notifier_env_in_process","time":{"start":1791959551986,"stop":1791959551990,"duration":4},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"_isolate_ambient_task_record_dir","time":{"start":1791959551986,"stop":1791959551986,"duration":0},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"_stub_escala